(* EnfGuard v2 base policy — no-op fallback.

   This file is used only when `enfguard.yaml` declares no policies. It
   intentionally enforces nothing. Write your real policies in YAML; the
   loader will materialise them as `state/enfguard_composite.mfotl`.

   For copy-paste-able example policies (P1..P9), see
   `examples/inspiration_policies.mfotl`. *)

ALWAYS TRUE
